# output.md, qcbridge-aja.md, qcbridge-ndi.md — the Output cards. This batch switches the REAL sinks on (QCBridgeN, and
# QCBridgeA on the AJA card): run it only with the card free, and expect bars on the reference monitor for a few seconds.
size 1440 1000
open MEDIA/Color Bars 1080p.mov
wait 1.5
click 95 366
wait 0.5
output start ndi
wait 5.0
leave
shot qcv3_046 0 340 280 268
shot qcv3_054 0 510 280 92
output stop ndi
output transfer aja 2
output start aja
wait 7.0
shot qcv3_047 0 340 280 350
shot qcv3_053 0 386 280 242
output stop aja
wait 1.5
quit
